<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">  &lt;/</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">description</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">&gt;</span></span>
